Wait — but there's a subtlety: availableWidth of the ScrollView excludes scrollbar? Control.availableWidth = width - leftInset - rightInset? Hmm. In QQC2, ScrollView.availableWidth exists (Qt 6.0+: "availableWidth : real — width minus left and right padding"). Padding vs scrollbar... The pose dialog's usage works in practice (the plan review said "The pose dialog already uses the correct mechanism (width: poseScroll.availableWidth)"). Copy that.

